rent completes, `--run-all` follows each registered child collection\nrecursively. This is explicit by design: Supervisor never scans and executes\narbitrary directories. Named-project collection state is stored in that\nworkspace's `.state/` directory, so generated task IDs such as `R0001` remain\nisolated across projects. Set `SUPERVISOR_DATABASE_PATH` only when deliberately\nsharing state.\n\n## Updating project configuration safely\n\n`supervisor update` fast-forwards the project-owned `supervisor/` checkout,\nreinstalls its CLI, then runs the newly downloaded version's environment\nmigrations. The authoritative, append-only history is committed to the\nSupervisor repository in `supervisor/env_migrations.json`. `supervisor update`\ncompares that manifest with `SUPERVISOR_ENV_SCHEMA_VERSION` in the project's\nprivate project-root `.env`, adds missing safe defaults or declared renamed keys, and never\noverwrites an existing project value.\n\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:736:def _prepare_project_workspace(workspace: Path) -> None:\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:766:        # `projects/` directory.  A project workspace is\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:774:def _record_initial_art_direction(workspace: Path, project_slug: str, brief: str) -> str:\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:803:        # `supervisor/` checkout, not from the project workspace itself.\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:827:    _prepare_project_workspace(path.parent)\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:940:    _prepare_project_workspace(path.parent)\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:1016:    for workspace in sorted(path for path in projects_directory.iterdir() if path.is_dir() and (path / \"INITIAL.md\").is_file()):\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:1041:        print(f\"No named project workspaces found in {projects_directory}.\")\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:1578:      List named project workspaces, progress, next task, and resume commands.\nsupervisor/supervisor/manage.py:1596:    initial_par